!}

Surprisingly,[? if president_ideology != "Left" and not presidential_powers: despite reluctance on both sides due to fears that the <span style="color: #808080;">reactionary</span> President will order a <i>Commonwealth intervention</i> if a coalition were to form,?] <span style="color: #c00000;">Red</span> Dornwich is restored! 

[? if (president_ideology == "Moderate" or president == "DuFour") and not presidential_powers: As one of the most left-wing and industrial states in the Commonwealth, we will use our leverage to implement comprehensive reforms and transform Dornwich into a stronghold of <span style="color: #c00000;">Reformism</span>. The President’s patience is especially thin. Tread carefully. ?]
[? if president_ideology == "Left" or presidential_powers: As one of the most left-wing and industrial states in the Commonwealth, we will use our leverage to implement comprehensive reforms and transform Dornwich into a stronghold of <span style="color: #c00000;">Reformism</span>. However, rumors of a far-right coup attempt are growing. Tread carefully. ?]

@president_nope

- @joever

@joever
title: President [+ president +] immediately orders a <i>Commonwealth intervention</i> against the Dornish government.  
on-arrival: reichsex_sax_trigger = 1

@no_majority
title: No majority can be found!
subtitle: [? if true_bourgeois_coalition_saxony < 50 and marcher_coalition_saxony < 50: All possible coalitions lack a majority. ?][? if marcher_coalition_saxony >= 50 and not marcher_coalition_possible_saxony: The propertied parties are antagonistic to our Dornish organization. ?][? if marcher_coalition_saxony >= 50 and left_strength >= 20: Our party itself rejects the possibility of a majority coalition with the liberals. ?]
view-if: not saxony_marcher_maj and true_bourgeois_coalition_saxony < 50 and (marcher_coalition_saxony < 50 or (not marcher_coalition_possible_saxony or left_strength >= 20)) and (collectivist_r_saxony + sapd_r_saxony) < 50 and royalist_r_saxony < 50 and marcher_r_saxony < 50

With the propertied parties unable to secure a majority, and the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span> refusing to enter government, the state Assembly is in a deadlock. The Sheckley Cabinet remains in power as a caretaker government, but a simple majority vote can still dissolve the state Assembly, making toleration a necessity.

[? if mega_bourgeois_coalition_saxony >= 50: The coalition of parties in between the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> and the anti-democratic Right constitute a majority, but it is our decision whether or not to tolerate the incumbent government, to prevent new elections from being called. ?][? if mega_bourgeois_coalition_saxony < 50: The coalition of parties in between the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> and the anti-democratic Right don't even constitute a majority, making any majority government impossible. ?]

- @toleration_saxony
- @sapd_aspd_ddp
- @no_majority_2

@no_majority_2
title: A majority still can't be found!
subtitle: [? if mega_bourgeois_coalition_saxony < 50: Even with our votes, it is still joever for the coalition. ?][? if mega_bourgeois_coalition_saxony >= 50: We will refuse to tolerate the propertied government, forcing new elections. ?]
view-if: (not saxony_no_majority_2 or far_right_coalition_saxony < 50) 
on-arrival: saxony_1933_trigger_time = time + 3; saxony_no_majority_2 = 1; saxony_no_majority = 1 if not saxony_no_majority; saxony_no_majority += 1 if saxony_no_majority; burgher_royalist += 3; guild_royalist += 3; landed_royalist += 3; disfavored_royalist += 3; pro_republic -= 3; burgher_marcher -= 2 if toleration_possible_saxony; guild_marcher -= 2 if toleration_possible_saxony; landed_marcher -= 1 if toleration_possible_saxony; reformist_dissent += 10 if toleration_possible_saxony; left_dissent -= 5 if toleration_possible_saxony; saxony_toleration = 0; saxony_groko = 0; red_saxony = 0; saxony_joever = 0; saxony_marcher = 0; saxony_right_2 = 0; saxony_royalist = 0; saxony_marcher_splinter = 0; saxony_soclib = 0; saxony_royalist_maj = 0; saxony_collectivist = 0; saxony_marcher_maj = 0

With no viable alternatives, the state Assembly faces dissolution, triggering new elections—an opportunity the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span> hopes to exploit by capitalizing on political instability and the perceived failure of parliamentary democracy.

@spd_majority
title: Form a Marchers only government!
subtitle: Sweat...
view-if: marcher_r_saxony >= 50 and not saxony_marcher_maj
on-arrival: saxony_marcher = 1; reformist_dissent -= 5; left_dissent -= 30; left_strength += 10; center_dissent -= 10; labor_dissent -= 10; aspd_dead = 1; commons_marcher += 7; commons_collectivist -= 4; burgher_marcher += 3; guild_marcher += 2; disfavored_marcher += 4; disfavored_royalist -= 3; pro_republic += 5; saxony_toleration = 0; saxony_groko = 0; red_saxony = 0; saxony_joever = 0; saxony_right_2 = 0; saxony_royalist = 0; saxony_marcher_splinter = 0; saxony_soclib = 0; saxony_royalist_maj = 0; saxony_collectivist = 0; saxony_marcher_maj = 1

Unexpectedly, we've found ourselves controlling a majority of the Dornwich landtag and being able to form a government of just the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span>! It is unclear how the propertied and <span style="color: #808080;">reactionaries</span> will react to a <span style="color: #c00000;">Red</span> Dornwich but without the collectivists... [? if aspd_share > 0: The ORP seeing as we no longer require on coalition negoations to form government has decided to join us. ?] 
